## Some transitive dependencies (currently @wallet-standard/base and
## @solana/wallet-standard-features, pulled in via @creit.tech/stellar-wallets-kit's
## optional Solana wallet support) declare an "engines.node" requirement of
## ">=22" in their own package.json, newer than this project's own stated
## contract (package.json engines.node is ">=20", matched by the Node 20
## pinned across .github/workflows/*.yml and the Dockerfile). This advisory
## field doesn't reflect code this project actually exercises, so yarn's
## default hard failure on a mismatch is overly strict here.
##
## If/when this project bumps its own Node version requirement, reconsider
## whether this override is still needed.
engine-strict false
